{"3156050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Special Case", "steam_appid": 3156050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a high-tech occupation force locked down your home, they thought they had won. They bombed your districts, enslaved your people, and turned your metropolis into a fortress of tyranny. They didn't count on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ahmed, a teenager who awakens with volatile, reality-bending powers during the invasion. As the city bleeds, you become its last line of defense. Master a fluid, gravity-defying moveset to traverse the urban jungle, and unleash devastating abilities to dismantle the occupiers piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ULTIMATE URBAN PLAYGROUND</strong><br>The city isn't just a backdrop; it's your battleground. Use your parkour mastery to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind</strong> along power lines and monorail tracks at breakneck speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-Run</strong> up skyscrapers and across sprawling construction sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/96624f99c6445dd587378dfb2d610e0b.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/96624f99c6445dd587378dfb2d610e0b.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/96624f99c6445dd587378dfb2d610e0b.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash &amp; High Jump</strong> to chain aerial combos and escape overwhelming firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/f934838ccbcd85006872d9caad9da5f3.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/f934838ccbcd85006872d9caad9da5f3.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/f934838ccbcd85006872d9caad9da5f3.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse four distinct islands—from the shattered ruins of the destroyed district to the opulent, fortified compounds of the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/8514450a014047972df703c311583495.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/8514450a014047972df703c311583495.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/8514450a014047972df703c311583495.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVASTATE THE OCCUPATION</strong><br>You aren't just a survivor; you are a weapon of mass liberation. Unleash a growing arsenal of superhuman abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telekinetic Fury:</strong> Rip patrol vehicles from the ground, crush attack drones mid-flight, and send squads of soldiers flying with a wave of your hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fc3f4ca1fbb81343e2fadf1b2152ccfb.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fc3f4ca1fbb81343e2fadf1b2152ccfb.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fc3f4ca1fbb81343e2fadf1b2152ccfb.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Onslaught:</strong> Hurl searing fireballs or shift into a blazing inferno form, turning your body into a walking incendiary bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/47a3a2e46c7252b91ec7e2bf87618adf.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/47a3a2e46c7252b91ec7e2bf87618adf.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/47a3a2e46c7252b91ec7e2bf87618adf.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbreakable Defense:</strong> Erect powerful Force Fields that block rocket barrages and detonate on impact, clearing the area around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/61f4ced2c9836228e3417a94f6d077a4.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/61f4ced2c9836228e3417a94f6d077a4.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/61f4ced2c9836228e3417a94f6d077a4.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Melee:</strong> Combine devastating ground-pounds with agile combos that chain into ranged energy blasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fef144748f48b59183b8d4b92d8d8a95.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fef144748f48b59183b8d4b92d8d8a95.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/fef144748f48b59183b8d4b92d8d8a95.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT AN ADAPTIVE MILITARY MACHINE</strong><br>The enemy learns. As you grow stronger, their tactics escalate. Face a relentless war machine including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patroling Soldiers &amp; Static Snipers</strong> hunting you from the rooftops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated Drones &amp; Laser Turrets</strong> locking down key zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armored Helicopters &amp; Rocket Launchers</strong> turning the streets into kill zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Forces Units</strong> that adapt to counter your specific playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY OF RESISTANCE</strong><br>The occupation destroyed one of the islands to clear a path for their settlements, forcing families from their homes and executing those who stayed. This isn't just about survival—it's about vengeance and liberation. Fight through a gripping campaign where your choices determine the fate of the city's remaining citizens. Unlock unique skins, discover hidden collectibles, and upgrade your abilities to become the ultimate symbol of defiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The method of liberation is yours to choose. Become the spark that ignites the revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your Special Case.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a high-tech occupation force locked down your home, they thought they had won. They bombed your districts, enslaved your people, and turned your metropolis into a fortress of tyranny. They didn't count on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ahmed, a teenager who awakens with volatile, reality-bending powers during the invasion. As the city bleeds, you become its last line of defense. Master a fluid, gravity-defying moveset to traverse the urban jungle, and unleash devastating abilities to dismantle the occupiers piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ULTIMATE URBAN PLAYGROUND</strong><br>The city isn't just a backdrop; it's your battleground. Use your parkour mastery to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind</strong> along power lines and monorail tracks at breakneck speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/42b2b843f9ca48ed7996610d3917d44c.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall-Run</strong> up skyscrapers and across sprawling construction sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/96624f99c6445dd587378dfb2d610e0b.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/96624f99c6445dd587378dfb2d610e0b.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source