li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Forces Units</strong> that adapt to counter your specific playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY OF RESISTANCE</strong><br>The occupation destroyed one of the islands to clear a path for their settlements, forcing families from their homes and executing those who stayed. This isn't just about survival—it's about vengeance and liberation. Fight through a gripping campaign where your choices determine the fate of the city's remaining citizens. Unlock unique skins, discover hidden collectibles, and upgrade your abilities to become the ultimate symbol of defiance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The method of liberation is yours to choose. Become the spark that ignites the revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.poster.avif?t=1784208605\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.webm?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156050/extras/113913b01b231bc954b11203a1f954f9.mp4?t=1784208605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your Special Case.</strong></p>", "short_description": "You won't win a war as a one man army, But because you keep fighting you are still alive_Mohamed Mostafa Battle the Occupation with unique super powers! Destroy helicopters, drones, and armored vehicles. Explore &quot;The Strip,&quot; protect its people, and rebuild a war-torn world. Welcome to Special Case", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https:/